  "holistic_F_N": 2,
  "holistic_F_H": -2,
  "section_notes": "S1 requires serious incidents within 24h and other confirmed incidents within 30 days, with customer notice within 5 business days. S2 sets 55°C testing and a 5% review trigger but does not stop sales above 5%, weakening it. S3 requires new-unit shut-off at 24 months and retrofit at 6 years; S4 requires built-in suppression at 36 months; S5 mandates recall at 8/100k with immediate notice and no serious-injury clause."
